<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 73,719.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 73,719.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of December 4 totaled 73,719 bales, up from 73,097 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 622 bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 1,747 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640</p>
